# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Operator data — NEVER commit real account state
#
# This repo reasons about the operator's own LLM subscriptions. Live oracle dumps carry
# real emails, organization UUIDs and usage numbers. Root-level captures and scratch
# space are ignored; the one committed sample is the REDACTED test fixture below.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
/cswap-*.json
/*.local.json
/scratch/
/tmp/
/.tmp/

# ...but the redacted fixture is part of the test suite and must stay tracked.
!tests/fixtures/cswap_real.json
